                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Mr Moss read your minute on his dinner hour,\" Dorcas Fenn says from the ladder. \"Said it was well put. He reads everything, so I can't tell you what that's worth, but he doesn't say it about everything.\"",
                "choices": [
