                        "equals": "kept"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "Dorcas Fenn looks at the oilcloth bundle you are carrying and does not ask. \"Carters' books are never filed,\" she says. \"Twenty years of the river and none of it in here.\" She very nearly smiles. \"Don't let it get damp. That's all I ask of anybody.\"",
