                "text": "You copy it out at the reading desk, both pages, and Dorcas Fenn takes the pennies without comment and gives you a sheet of good paper for nothing, which you suspect she has never done before. \"Pin it somewhere it can be read,\" she says. \"That's the whole of the job.\"",
