                "text": "She writes it in her slow clerk's hand: the date, your name as informant, Tull and Coyle as sources, and then fifteen lines, peg, date, face, cause, and the name as given. At the head of the page, where an entry usually has its subject, she writes after a moment: The Deepworks. Dead. She blots it. \"There,\" she says. \"Now anybody can ask.\"",
